						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">I can&#039;t believe I agree with Kinladar, but it takes a long time for people to realize that no matter how good they personally are, they wouldn&#039;t be shit without the effort of 53 or 71 or more people helping them get where they are - and that&#039;s just the one fight.  That doesn&#039;t even come close in to taking in to account the 22 or so slots of gear, all the past flags, the exp, the AAs, the general mob knowledge and every little iota of learning that comes in to play.  Hell you should even thank the pimply faced little kid at the Electronics store that sold you the game in the first place.  Thats just one man&#039;s opinion though.</td>
