						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Slayerr,<br /><br />First of all whatever happens in EiE is between me, my officers and my members - period.  Whatever was said and done was done with the intention of being fair to the members and maintaining the good reputation that EiE and every single member it has had since it&#039;s inception has worked hard on getting and then maintaining.<br /><br />In additon, anything that may be an EiE issue does not overflow to DA and vice versa.  We are one alliance, but we are most deinfitely two separate guilds.  If you want to call out both of us, you better have your facts straight.<br /><br />Thirdly, this game is rarely about skill and more times about gear and play time.  The rich get richer scenario very much applies to the virtual world of Norrath as well.  I will be happy to allow you to tank anything that would be slightly above your current content on an EiE raid, but we do not feel like dropping back 2 years in content just to gear up our twinks for the night.<br /><br />Finally, DA &amp; EiE just beat the 6th MPG trial for full Anguish access after the most recent changes that Sony has made.  The first time we beat all of these trials, they were pretty much a joke for 3 of them and 3 took some practice.  The current setup of the trials makes the orginal ones look like NTOV.  We did this with mostly new and younger members, about 80% new clerics, 60% new tanks, and almost all of our &quot;support&quot; class people being apps or members under 30 days.  I can assure everyone that this was a herculean effort made by well over 70 people from those that were there everday to those that logged on when they could to help gear up everyone else so that we could beat the trials.<br /><br />Now when you can claim that you are responsible or even significantly contribute to an equal vault in progression for your own guild you can come here and make such challenges and you will have the respect of those that read this board daily.  Until then you are just one more person screaming like a child about something that you have no concept.  You are an unarmed man in a battle of wits.<br /><br />Feel free to prove me wrong.</td>
