						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">I was just thinking about this tonight while I had some down time thanks to my ISP and I realized something.&nbsp; From day one that people have been ranking guilds, DA/EiE has been in the middle of things.&nbsp; Whether it be WoW, EK, DF, AoD, Arirang, Ascent, Anthology, FoT, Conviction, or Happy Gnomes, we have been placed up against them all.&nbsp; And now, today we are firmly entrenched at the top spot.&nbsp; There is no one left to beat, we have won the penis contest.<br /><br />But see the thing is, nothing changes.&nbsp; I know I personally don&#039;t log in each night worrying about what we are going to do today to squash every single other guild on Rodcet.&nbsp; I log in each night worrying how we are going to get that person that missed their flag 85&#039;ed in to the new zone.&nbsp; I log in each night wondering how we are going to get that person needing the last piece of their epic, or the BiC or whatever quest that particular piece.&nbsp; I log in each night and worry about how we are going to get this new person that is raiding their next level 70 rune so that they don&#039;t feel useless every raid.&nbsp; I log in each night worrying about how we are going to work on the next mob in progression when Sony intentionally puts up a cockblock because they have unfinished content.&nbsp; I log in each night and worry about how we are going to interview the newest applicant when we have 5 raids scheduled and only 4 hours of game time to do it in and that particular class leader is out of town on vacation.&nbsp; You see there comes a time when you play this game (and admittedly for me it has just been very recently) that quite frankly you don&#039;t give two shits about anyone outside of your circle because there is so much pleasure gained from rewarding those that help you day in and day out that there isn&#039;t enough time or energy left to spend on anyone else.&nbsp; You realize it simply isn&#039;t worth it.</td>
